source: xtask/src/help.rs
expression: help_for(&path)
---
Build every cargo-fuzz target, seed it from the test fixtures and run it; needs the pinned nightly and cargo-fuzz

Usage: cargo xtask fuzz [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --seconds <N>
          Seconds per target (default 60, at most 3600)

      --target <NAME>
          Only this target

      --shard <I/N>
          Only every N-th target starting at index I (as CI's shards do)

  -h, --help
          Print help
